ROMX $74
	"Pokedex Entries 193-251"
	; Kanto hack: the ten S.S. ANNE maps (7h).  With their objects, trainers
	; and text they no longer fit in "Map Scripts 26"'s bank ($7b), and the
	; dex-entry banks are the largest stable free tails we have
	; (docs/M4-VERMILION.md "## 7h findings", 7h.2).
	"Map Scripts 27"
ROMX $75
	; Kanto hack: CELADON CITY's indoor maps, moved wholesale out of
	; "Map Scripts 7" by M6 9o (docs/M6-CELADON.md D27) so ROCKET HIDEOUT's
	; scripts have somewhere to grow.  D27 named bank $73 for this, but the
	; block is 8294 bytes and $73's tail is only 9391, which would leave 9x
	; about a kilobyte to rewrite all of Celadon in.  $75 is one of four
	; wholly EMPTY banks ($75 $76 $79 $7a) the survey's cost table missed.
	"Map Scripts 29"
ROMX $76
	; Kanto hack: the SAFARI ZONE's four areas, its gate, the four rest houses,
	; the secret house and FUCHSIA's new interiors (M7 10a, docs/M7-FUCHSIA.md
	; D47).  $76 is the second of the four wholly EMPTY banks named above.
	"Map Scripts 30"
