ROMX $79
	; Kanto hack: the Kanto metatile + collision tables (M7 10l,
	; docs/M7-FUCHSIA.md D48).  They used to float as "Tileset Data 9" and had
	; run bank $0a down to 6 free bytes; $79 is the third of the four wholly
	; EMPTY banks M7 10a named, and the tables are reached only through the
	; `dba` in data/tilesets.asm, so pinning them here costs nothing and gives
	; every remaining Kanto milestone room to append metatiles.
	"Tileset Data 14"
ROMX $7b
	"Battle Tower Text"
	; Kanto hack: Viridian Forest + its gates (docs/M2-FOREST.md). Pinned so
	; the section does not float into bank $01, which is nearly full.
	"Map Scripts 26"
ROMX $7c
	"Battle Tower Trainer Data"
	; Kanto hack: the two Pewter Museum maps pushed "Maps" past the end of
	; bank $25, so the overworld event loop moved here (docs/M2-PEWTER.md, 4d).
	"Events"
